# - Qobuz, 1T1 artist page, Music Story biography and discography (opened 2026-10-20): French speaking singer from the French West Indies, specialising in bouyon, soca and dancehall, native of Guadeloupe; collaborations Bla Bla Bla with Shanika and HollyG, SIkre Kon Miel with Luky and Nils, Moustik, PnL (Piney), CHORD EP released in 2024 including Bouwey. Release dates used here: SIcre Kon Miel and Bidiba Bidibou 2 June 2023, bla bla bla 2 August 2023, Aknose Moustik 28 September 2023, Pied au Plancher and Gasolina and Bad Girls 1 December 2023, Mas La Rive 12 January 2024, Oui Nou Monss 7 June 2024, Party Rocking 10 June 2024, Leave Me Alone 6 September 2024, Bay Li 27 November 2024, CHORD 13 December 2024, Ouba 5 December 2025, In Di Corner 30 January 2026.
# - AB BOYZ Music, label article 1T1: Le nouveau phenomene bouyon, published 6 May 2024 (opened 2026-10-20): Guadeloupe composer and producer, made his name with Wa wa waaw with Theomaa, Moustik with Aknose, Sicre Kon Miel, joined the AB BOYZ label.
# - quel-dj.com, Playlist Shatta and Bouyon (opened 2026-10-20): Bouwey by 1T1 with Theomaa, released December 2024, from the CHORD EP, a bright fusion of bouyon, soca and dancehall; Moustik by producer 1T1 and Aknose, released 29 September 2023, modern bouyon with Guadeloupean Creole lyrics.
# - CCN, Caraib Creole News, interview with Maite Berchel-Bordin, published 13 December 2025 (opened 2026-10-20): in Guadeloupe the most emblematic bouyon artists of the moment are Lejuh, 1T1, Theomaa, Piscine OSP, Aknose, Shanika.
# - Air Caraibes, Guadeloupe music page, via the on-disk dossier report.md (verified live in that research): 1T1 named among the artists who popularised bouyon in the archipelago, with Shanika, Theodora, KJF and Natoxie.
# - Shazam, 1T1 artist data (search index, 2026-10-20): Bouwey featuring Theomaa peaked at number 48 on the Shazam Global Chart, 7 days in the Top 50, Top 50 debut 22 March 2025, album CHORD EP 2024; top tracks Bouwey, In Di Corner, Wa wa Waaaw, Leave Me Alone, Moustik.
# - 1T1 official YouTube videos (search index, 2026-10-20): Bouwey, from the CHORD EP, composed by 1T1 and Dinho, written by 1T1 and Theomaa, recorded by 1T1, mixed by Jbreazy; Best Friend, from the CHORD EP, same production credits; Ouba with Theomaa, composed by Qwann and 1T1; In Di Corner featuring Miimii KDS, composed by 1T1, written by 1T1 and Miimii KDS. Official handles published in those descriptions: Instagram 1t1.off, YouTube @1t1beats.
# - Lejuh official YouTube clips (search index, 2026-10-20): Air Force 1, composer and producer 1T1; Lolita, produced by 1T1.
# Note: a gold certification for Bouwey is claimed in social media posts found in search, but no SNEP listing confirming it was found in the sources opened for this profile, so this profile does not present the certification as verified.

